      "message": "this works, but I think the polling should be significantly faster and/or the logic to force H1_VREF to OFF should be removed.\n\nUse case:\n\n1. Attach to DUT with Z-state support\n2. Use EC console to hibernate (enter Z-state)\n3. Monitor Cr50 console\n4. Hit physical power button to wake system\n\nYou are guaranteed to hit the \"DUT power button held\" condition.  In the meantime, you miss pretty much a full second of H1 boot spew, and there\u0027s a risk of missing more EC console log than necessary (with the current code, up to 1 second of logs after you release the power button).",
